{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d99f51a991a400f8a0cfb7371b35dc94e780cd37ff8d62a3ad3132773aceedfb", "ja": "（今日は音楽ホールでライブだ。もうすぐ\nリハーサルだけど、静香はどこに行ったのかな？）", "zh": "（今天要在音乐厅举办演唱会。马上就要彩排了，静香去哪儿了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e30721209e073a3cf09e0938573d3fb5db4406cfead591eb8bf7dc9aa1a9f8dc", "ja": "お疲れ様、静香。\nこんなところにいたんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。\n原来你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "dfda8b5651778eedc666fcd3e6c5f695bafd6a8ca5cc402b77c288f0cd6817fa", "ja": "あれ、{$P$}？\n……あっ、リハーサルの時間！", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}？\n……啊，彩排的时间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "44d7a7762eea79407658a75ac12417cc88e397408ce3e73f8115c51a8f420172", "ja": "す、すみません……。\nちょっと懐かしくて、いろいろ見てしまって。", "zh": "对、对不起……  \n只是觉得有点怀念，不知不觉看了好多东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7e36995da2780c1ee8132b946126dfd35f3ff985a32f3b2d861eb865424ebf40", "ja": "懐かしい？\n静香は、ここに来たことがあるのか？", "zh": "令人怀念？\n静香，你以前来过这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "6292307948e6e102c420a447b062c3c97859f05cc738763736cea544870cd521", "ja": "はい。幼稚園の頃に、ピアノのコンクールで。\n初めて賞を取ったのも、この会場でした。", "zh": "是的。上幼儿园的时候，我来这里参加过钢琴比赛。\n我第一次获奖，也是就在这个会场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "3d49d866d0b4cf8980abb2af325862fefd590e197ab2fea4bb7a4a9550b29efc", "ja": "あの時は、珍しく父が見に来てくれて……。\nピアノを頑張ろうって思ったのを、思い出しました。", "zh": "那时候，难得父亲也来看我……让我想起了自己曾下定决心要努力练钢琴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bf08a8c7c443125bf77aa4158ed2a23d96dd9cb25e49c3a0f9f33b140239474b", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n静香にとって、思い出の場所なんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样。\n对静香来说，这是个充满回忆的地方啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "ab040204b6d10a7a276f398a935a460aad26d2b668661f0ed07827dffe0f49ee", "ja": "ええ。いつもは厳しい父も、私が賞を取ると\n「頑張ったな」って褒めてくれるんです。", "zh": "是的。平时一向严厉的父亲，在我获奖时也会夸我：\n“你努力了啊。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "76251bb69e305b4ccef2f8fa11d6f26187faa27fc56c204ec3ba47f85a45ac8f", "ja": "それが、すごい嬉しかったんです……。\n私の頑張りを認めてくれたんだって、わかったから。", "zh": "那让我特别开心……因为我明白了，爸爸认可了我的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8bef0b95d1117b29815be7c37d859006e8be7490fabc9d0445281c0384ac0f41", "ja": "そうか。それなら今度は、\n静香が頑張ってる夢を認めてもらう番だな。", "zh": "这样啊。那接下来，就轮到静香让别人认可自己为梦想努力的身影了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "384b28da0698dd9503cbd1f9cdffac2f055201fc2ade9a3c1cb82449ae11f25d", "ja": "私の夢……。\n本当に、認めてもらえるのかな……。", "zh": "我的梦想……\n真的能得到认可吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5919c326e9c77044acef2b89d28cf43cc9852bfa3e6d5cb707a5da1dabc36da9", "ja": "絶対にお父さんに認めてもらう！\nそのために、静香は頑張ってるんじゃないのか？", "zh": "一定要得到爸爸的认可！\n静香不就是为了这个才一直努力的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1013_p", "source_sha256": "396f78b8dbe116f4850697f597b660d780d92282df17c93d56ac4d916a5cc552", "ja": "今は厳しいかもしれない。でも、静香の頑張りは\n必ず静香のお父さんに伝わる。……俺はそう思うよ。", "zh": "现在可能还很难。不过，静香的努力一定会传达到她父亲那里。……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "792d7d8ab3ad7c74b081980913e928fdbdb67d9219ca00cdd7e2cb1b86cb179c", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます。\n私、また弱気になってましたね。", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢您。\n我又变得没信心了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "44d308241cdaa9d8723d7f7b1019ea6137724dd58fa144b602c5e2ffffd1bc28", "ja": "認めてもらいます……絶対に。努力は無駄じゃないって\n……ピアノで学んだはずなのに、忘れてました。", "zh": "我一定会得到认可的……绝对会。努力不会白费，这是\n学钢琴时就该明白的道理，我却忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1016_p", "source_sha256": "35fe9787f3413e5ecf51eff7dd862c61836f2d37e85459fbe50080365fc078f9", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ。アイドルになった姿を見て、\nお父さんが褒めてくれる未来だって、夢じゃない。", "zh": "啊，就是要有这股干劲。等你成为偶像后，爸爸看到你的样子并夸奖你——这样的未来也并不是梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "40ed119cb8804407f373c21c2ce0013beb8507de6d2592245f3cbf32a7aca473", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね……。\nこれまで以上にアイドルを頑張れば、いつかは……。", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是……  \n只要比以往更加努力成为偶像，总有一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "f287508299322bf67d395e63b3c86b9e2e774b46ea4321bd02482c6cc76d62d4", "ja": "でも私ひとりじゃ、叶えるのは難しいかもしれません。\nだから……これからも力を貸してください！", "zh": "但是只靠我一个人，或许很难实现。\n所以……今后也请继续助我一臂之力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1019_p", "source_sha256": "900a81ada426d20dfbb4263cbbaf3dacddceec5d128a64ae1d7fc23355f1955e", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。静香をトップアイドルにするのが\n仕事なんだ。これからも、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "啊，当然。让静香成为顶尖偶像就是我的工作。今后也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "6add66a8627efc00429651c1beb2817aaba8e5cbe93d1b91996fe2f0dbffa1ad", "ja": "は、はい……！\nよろしくお願いします、{$P$}！", "zh": "是、是……！\n今后还请多多关照，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0314_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a766ef3f23517be3778f79ea82dbf3b36f7e49bf11e70e4a9be87660ead43e23", "ja": "（静香の頑張りは、必ずお父さんに届くはずだ。\nそのために、もっとプロデュースを頑張らないとな！）", "zh": "（静香的努力，一定能传达到她父亲那里。\n为了这个目标，我也得更加努力地做好制作人才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
